# NOTE: /public/uploads and /prisma/seed-data are deliberately NOT ignored.
# They hold the migrated WordPress media and the migrated content snapshot, so a
# fresh clone can run `prisma migrate deploy && prisma db seed` with no network.
# Re-running `npm run migrate:wp` refreshes both in place.

# Raw HTTP cache used by the migration script
